          "html": "Enter the portal and watch the cutscene.<br>Make sure you go through each dialogue box, otherwise it will kick you out of the portal and you will have to start the cutscene from the start.",
          "text": "Enter the portal and watch the cutscene.Make sure you go through each dialogue box, otherwise it will kick you out of the portal and you will have to start the cutscene from the start.",
          "dialogue": [
